OL,3,GNEWSAPartial hearing loss in children
OL,4,Aoverlooked, parents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren with partial or mild hearing
OL,7,Floss can encounter challenges in
OL,8,Feveryday environments that go unnoticed
OL,9,Fdue to their diagnosis, parents say.
OL,11,FArlo, eight, from Cottingham, has
OL,12,Funilateral hearing loss, or
OL,13,Fsingle-sided deafness, which wasn't
OL,14,Fpicked up by healthcare professionals
OL,15,Funtil she was two.
OL,17,FShe uses a hearing aid, but busier
OL,18,Fenvironments such as a classroom can
OL,19,Fmake it difficult to concentrate, or
OL,20,Fpinpoint individual speakers, according
OL,21,Fto her mum Ali.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
